    "Design a menu matching the profile vibe for {guests} people with dietary needs {diet}, where every dish is safe for a pregnant guest of honour (no unpasteurised cheese, raw or undercooked egg, deli meats, high-mercury fish, alcohol). Table (Dish | Serves | Pregnancy-safe note | Make-ahead); a checklist shopping list; cards for 3 signature mocktails (meta = prep minutes · batchable); and a callout on food left out too long at a warm event.",
