    "Write invitation wording for the profile celebration at {details} with gift approach '{registry}'. Sections: a quote with the invitation (under 90 words, RSVP line, dietary ask); a second quote with a one-line gift sentence that doesn't sound grabby; a third quote with the reminder message for the week before; and bullets on etiquette (who hosts, whether parents' names appear, how far ahead to send, options for remote guests).",
